প্রশ্ন : If X : Y = 13 : 12 and X &ndash; Y = 2, then what is value of 2X + 3Y?<br />সমাধান :&nbsp;
<div>Let the value of X and Y be 13z and 12z<br />&rArr; X &ndash; Y = 2<br />&rArr; 13z &ndash; 12z = 2<br />&rArr; z = 2</div>
<div><br />&rArr; The value of X = 13z = 26<br />&rArr; The value of Y = 12z = 24<br />&rArr; 2X + 3Y = 52 + 72 = 124<br /><br />&there4; The value of (2X + 3Y) is 124.</div>
